%% Risk decision lifecycle — adopted owner-amended baseline; unresolved parameters remain in the Open Decisions register.
flowchart TD
  Inputs[Proposal + allocation + mode permission] --> Lock[Portfolio gate transaction]
  Lock --> Refresh[Refresh Ledger / shared reservations / qualification / capabilities / policy]
  Refresh --> Rules[Deterministic rule evaluation]
  Rules --> Reject[REJECT: zero allowed]
  Rules --> Resize[RESIZE: smaller positive quantity]
  Rules --> Approve[APPROVE: requested admissible quantity]
  Resize --> Commit[Commit decision / reservation / order intent / outbox]
  Approve --> Commit
  Reject --> Audit[Persist reasons / no authorization]
  Commit --> Gate[Recheck action-specific controls / health / qualification before dispatch]
  Gate -->|Stale / halted| Block[Block or re-evaluate]
  Gate -->|Valid| Submit[Admit one logical paper submission]
